    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink165-kilavi">
        ituvumatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        This one is that [= the previous one].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink165">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>yaṟukaḻic ciṟumī ṉāra māntun</l>
<l>tuṟaivaṉ colliya colle</l>
<l>ṉiṟaiyē relvaḷai koṇṭuniṉ ṟatuvē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The words that were spoken by the man of the shore</l>
        <l>In which the small, white croww of the great seashore</l>
        <l>Eats in order to be full, small fish from the depleted backwaters,</l>
        <l>Continuously take [away] [my] dense, superior, bright bangles.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
